2. Asymptotic center coefficients
   For R=max(E)>=4, the universal-center reservoir has coefficient coeff/R.
  both odd and 3-free        P=(1, 5, 7, 11, 13): coeff=13/42 = 0.309524
  odd but has multiple of 3  P=(1, 3, 5): coeff=3/14 = 0.214286
  3-free but has even        P=(1, 2, 5): coeff=2/21 = 0.095238
  mixed residual             P=(1, 2, 3): coeff=0 = 0.000000

